Lobium — HC-4 deep WebGL surfaces (version / shadingLanguageVersion / extensions / shaderPrecision).

Routes the already-parsed config fields through Blink so a persona's claimed GPU class agrees with
getParameter(VERSION|SHADING_LANGUAGE_VERSION), getSupportedExtensions()/getExtension(), and
getShaderPrecisionFormat(). Empty/absent fields leave the host value (fail-open). Confirmed needed by
battle-test on real GPUs: extension set + precision leaked the host while UNMASKED_RENDERER was spoofed.

No BUILD.gn change (hooks live in already-wired webgl module); no config-schema change (reader already
parses these fields). Requires a Lobium rebuild on the build VPS to prove in binary.

